                  <nc xml:id="m-bbd82b99-df78-47d1-acf9-1b796ac54342" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-1e78ec17-4cb2-4249-a78b-b934c708091e" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-2c3f6451-1079-47e1-b85f-e52aa257536c" facs="#m-e9329ab4-c9d1-4fbb-ba3a-37abba63820e" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c1e91031-b4ea-4493-aabc-20fdfc6fe84c"><lg xml:id="m-8af74414-ec57-4a29-b4d9-d223eeb01f0c"><l xml:id="m-9badef3a-3fbf-4536-af45-1d22b40f2a4e" facs="#m-1140e084-b024-423b-98e1-70819bfde832" label="ambiguous">(40)</l><l xml:id="m-16243a3d-98b2-4f4b-bff4-afbf4a43a0f9" facs="#m-833452ae-e247-4ece-8298-5cc100970251" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-3c27f729-cb22-4828-b571-d3e69afda678" facs="#m-3684ed86-ee71-4df5-b9a8-42e3f292971a" label="lyrics-like">Offertory. Afferéntur régi. p. 1219.</l><l xml:id="m-62027be5-5131-46cc-98ca-2cfc72584970" facs="#m-34cede41-df50-41a5-b256-f99bd30fd2b2" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-ff6aa957-2421-4211-9b8e-a06e345b1314" facs="#m-d6cf4ce6-5f87-4e77-9430-52c0f4ad78e5" label="lyrics-like">HDésto, Dómine, supplicatió¬ tátem et caritátem Cordis tui,</l><l xml:id="m-f4bd8a64-853c-4d97-b7bb-0b033bacba8b" facs="#m-a9405270-5169-41d3-9ae2-bc7aabb84f13" label="lyrics-like">Il nibus nostris, adésto muné-nobis salutária reddántur: Qui</l><l xml:id="m-3236fb78-c1eb-4094-984c-9f39512d9395" facs="#m-1c5a5ff2-d9bf-45ae-8f9b-22fc6ef4feaa" label="lyrics-like">ribus, ut, interveniénte sancta vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre,</l><l xml:id="m-597c7c11-3e42-46e2-9950-185b49fbcc04" facs="#m-36a052f2-6655-433f-8b3f-10cc9463e79f" label="lyrics-like">Magdaléna Sophía, per humili-lin unitâte Spiritus...</l><l xml:id="m-2fa2417d-66e4-432b-9a1e-f1d769c341d2" facs="#m-370811c2-fc0a-4493-9218-f146fd794822" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-ab349b32-c863-4b21-95b9-ace048998148" facs="#m-21bb7791-024b-45e2-b438-44d92a644fe7" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-24445f3e-3aed-45e3-b92b-6185e12c36bb" facs="#m-5ee2805e-b519-4e87-9239-9b63f18f3429" label="lyrics-like">UI suscépe-rit" únum párvu-lum ta-lem in nómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-23d61303-a34b-4085-98c1-a7dd3c5478c0" facs="#m-7c6c27f7-e0a1-4717-beff-fd2dccc98298" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5088b64-c77a-4bcf-b24e-f4a775e39178" facs="#m-071b14de-09c4-4c65-850f-789bbb9428b6" label="lyrics-like">súsci-pit. P. T. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-836ee262-b60c-470d-aee1-dfea3bef85ff" facs="#m-1050d8ab-2ea9-4ee6-99d4-8dcd519186c9" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-7643f519-eedb-4414-8c65-b86415a99d26" facs="#m-232ac41f-75bc-474b-87df-e058507c8d04" label="lyrics-like">ne mé-o me</l><l xml:id="m-62b0231d-3e0a-4998-b5e4-cce3ba5a8de1" facs="#m-e3037f4c-eddf-4882-85e5-9fa5b6780e21" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion</l><l xml:id="m-8b81b0f2-200e-4583-8d11-18f68bf80ae2" facs="#m-1da07698-af34-40b7-b46a-49425af5a996" label="lyrics-like">VAelésti dape reféctos, fac ¡lénam Sophiam ad perennem</l><l xml:id="m-45c60131-d688-48d2-8f4b-afd8eabd91b5" facs="#m-72c005a8-5ce7-425d-b70b-671d4ec08616" label="lyrics-like">Lnos, Dómine Jesu Christe, in lin caelis glóriam provexisti:</l><l xml:id="m-0de8ead5-e774-41b6-887d-5c4e63b72056" facs="#m-c4766914-fb01-4128-a265-645ce0b827c5" label="lyrics-like">humilitáte et caritáte Cordis tui Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-e1040b0e-70b2-4080-ae6c-c1192103bfe9" facs="#m-f8841709-4c04-4321-ac42-97b77a4de8db" label="lyrics-like">créscere; quibus sanctam Magda- in unitáte Spiritus...</l><l xml:id="m-14dcfb7e-8090-485c-ada2-002a482be3bd" facs="#m-f266eca6-ee9c-4526-a5bc-1fff13f629ec" label="ambiguous">MAY 30</l><l xml:id="m-022ecf49-8874-49b5-bfd6-cb22fef9ffe7" facs="#m-a41d4f18-3eca-4e31-9132-a7a23a63148e" label="ambiguous">St. Ferdinand, King, Confessor</l><l xml:id="m-975fe2ff-8740-40b8-b035-7d06abc1cb4b" facs="#m-4d66a2a7-4c67-42a7-ac62-698ed1cfe276" label="text-like">In the diocese of San Antonio</l><l xml:id="m-5d9ca85e-14aa-4ac1-b7e4-e01ea6863711" facs="#m-21cec371-21e4-40a5-822a-aca05713365e" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1204, except:</l><l xml:id="m-b41409ac-a1f9-4201-8d27-3b90c2214285" facs="#m-39c51e1b-e496-4bcf-8d84-8b015e31e0a5" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-dece74bd-a330-4147-9519-b7bbb4e2e56b" facs="#m-4ed5099c-a823-453f-9955-bb0123e21c90" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beáto Confessóri intercessióne muniti, * ab hó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4cc4506-2df5-45bf-8938-d311dec554cb" facs="#m-3b509c08-a3d1-4b0b-b45f-cdc16224d313" label="lyrics-like">tuo Ferdinándo praeliári praé- stibus mentis et córporis liberé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f86c9735-c597-4b7e-a5f8-8c445bb5a211" facs="#m-4ddcad7f-86a8-4c2e-b588-72814420ddbe" label="lyrics-like">lia tua, et fidei inimícos superâre! mur. Per Dóminum nostrum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-17abbf25-2d57-4c23-9386-870b54d40250" facs="#m-2f4c3bc4-0f34-4331-ae9a-8df434259893" label="lyrics-like">dedísti : t concéde; ut, ejus nos sum Christum, Filium tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-d3700509-34fb-4d78-83a7-bd933d6d4f3a" facs="#m-a8efa300-302a-4cc8-b814-86cc21a65299" label="ambiguous">JUNE 9</l><l xml:id="m-a54a4791-81aa-47bf-a248-75d62e0fc822" facs="#m-4d8798d6-3626-4a80-9c16-0180afeb20f9" label="ambiguous">St. Columba, Abbot</l><l xml:id="m-5b0e07c4-ee54-42aa-9c66-d463fcfeaa9c" facs="#m-64ae794f-22df-4d02-a8c9-2d81970c0dcb" label="ambiguous">I class</l><l xml:id="m-b4af2b14-dee6-4ed6-8fda-2f6b81fc23dc" facs="#m-b1cf9bf8-d6d1-4e38-973c-7fce96e288b3" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi, of Abbots, p. 1206.</l><l xml:id="m-c92a610c-b6a3-43c8-9aaf-0fb00f2be20b" facs="#m-9677b957-4288-4cda-8fda-e5c7599fc00f" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-4f89f1ff-c2ec-48bf-8e9a-9519f5761856" facs="#m-5979b579-623e-482f-9adb-e4564e0eb70a" label="lyrics-like">Ntercéssio nos, quaésumus, nostris méritis non valémus.</l><l xml:id="m-794248b4-0d9e-4f6d-9223-e4db0f66e6e6" facs="#m-18169e03-072e-4b74-9786-5acf4887e192" label="lyrics-like">L Dómine, beáti Colümbae Ab¬ ejus patrocinio assequámur. Pe</l><l xml:id="m-95f43e08-1baf-4d80-ab4d-8d4bf6e4af7a" facs="#m-2e0d540f-74d5-4a20-9adb-98eeba371bbd" label="lyrics-like">bátis comméndet: f ut, quod! Dóminum nostrum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>